        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production mix, at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production mix, at service station
This data set includes electricity requirements of a service station as well as emissions from losses. The data set represents the Swiss mix of services stations with high (92%), medium (6%) and low (2%) initial pressure. VOC emissions are calculated from gas losses and composition of Swiss natural gas.;
UUID: fd262d3e-c3a6-3f1d-9425-fc8f30253cf2
This data set includes electricity requirements of a natural gas service station as well as emissions from losses.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with a mix of with high (92%), medium (6%) and low (2%) initial pressure.
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fd262d3e-c3a6-3f1d-9425-fc8f30253cf2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
